  "description": "The Roadmachine ONE is endurance, refined. Its lightweight BMC Advanced Carbon frame is engineered to be compliant when the road is rough, responsive when precision matters, and effortlessly capable over long days. Every detail – from integrated cables to downtube storage and a rear light – ensures you and your carbon road bike are ready for unpredictable conditions.\nBuilt with top-tier performance in mind yet designed to be within reach of the serious rider, this version of the do-it-all road bike delivers the ride quality, feel and confidence you expect from BMC in a package accessible to more riders.\nA complete Shimano Ultegra Di2 groupset takes care of shifting and braking, keeping its performance as precise as this bike’s handling. Lightweight tubeless-ready wheels provide a reliable, responsive ride, while wide, fast-rolling tires smoothen out rough roads and keep momentum high on ribbon-like tarmac. Paired with our integrated RSM01 stem and Endurance Alloy handlebars, you get world-class ergonomics that balance control, comfort and confidence on every ride.\nFor a do-it-all endurance road bike, this is the ONE.",
